{
  "id": "contract:code-generation-proposal",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "format": "JSON_SCHEMA",
  "instructions": [
    "Retorne somente um objeto com files e entrypoints aderente ao JSON Schema.",
    "Cada arquivo MUST ser texto UTF-8 e MUST declarar path, content, encoding, mediaType, purpose, sourceModuleIds e sourcePlanItemIds.",
    "Cada arquivo MUST possuir ao menos uma referência em sourceModuleIds ou sourcePlanItemIds, e toda referência MUST existir na TechnicalSpecification.",
    "Todo módulo CREATE MUST possuir cobertura em files[].sourceModuleIds.",
    "A proposta MUST declarar ao menos um entrypoint e cada entrypoint MUST corresponder exatamente ao path de um arquivo declarado.",
    "Não retorne hashes, tamanhos, manifest, lineage, provenance ou propriedades adicionais."
  ],
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["files", "entrypoints"],
    "properties": {
      "files": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 96,
        "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/file" }
      },
      "entrypoints": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 16,
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512
        }
      }
    },
    "$defs": {
      "file": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "path",
          "content",
          "encoding",
          "mediaType",
          "purpose",
          "sourceModuleIds",
          "sourcePlanItemIds"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 512
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 65536
          },
          "encoding": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["UTF-8"]
          },
          "mediaType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "application/json",
              "application/sql",
              "application/yaml",
              "text/css",
              "text/html",
              "text/javascript",
              "text/markdown",
              "text/plain",
              "text/x-prisma",
              "text/typescript",
              "text/xml"
            ]
          },
          "purpose": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["SOURCE", "TEST", "CONFIGURATION", "DOCUMENTATION", "STYLE", "SCHEMA"]
          },
          "sourceModuleIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 80,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^MOD-[0-9]{3}$"
            }
          },
          "sourcePlanItemIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 80,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^PLAN-[0-9]{3}$"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
